# A Grown World: an island 8 km across, made the way nature makes it. Plates
# drifting together lifted its mountains, rivers carved its valleys while it
# rose, lakes fill its hollows, the wind from the west rains on the mountains'
# near side and leaves their far side dry; sand on the shores, grass, forest
# where it is wet and warm, bare rock high up. The land and trees near you are
# made as you walk (`world`, rebuild step 12; the map: `loop world 3`). It
# puts you somewhere good, looking towards the mountains.
use "grown_island"
title "A Grown World"
mode "game"
grown_island(3)
look "natural"
